// hifive1 for the board check: Renode 1.17's platforms/cpus/sifive-fe310.repl with the CLINT's timer
// (mtime) counting at 16 MHz, the rate Zephyr's hifive1 programs its system timer for
// (sys_clock_hw_cycles_per_sec() = 16000000). Renode's file counts it at 62 MHz, so every kernel
// period came out 3.9 times too short (k_busy_wait(1 ms) held a pin 0.258 ms).
using "platforms/cpus/sifive-fe310.repl"

clint:
    frequency: 16000000
